[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0010","text":"啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0020","text":"不好意思，就在这附近"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0030","text":"……诶\n美琴小姐，要在这里下车吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0040","text":"嗯，想去练习一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0050","text":"…………\n这个时间的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0060","text":"啊，那个……如果您不介意的话，\n可以一起吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0070","text":"我倒是无所谓……你确定吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0080","text":"是的！　我今天也有想在今天之内\n记住的舞蹈动作"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0090","text":"……这样\n那我们就两个人一起练习吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0100","text":"好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
